==== FCALC.BASICS
fcalc> set echo
fcalc> ! fcalc's basics: numbers, operators, variables, and messages.
fcalc> ! Numbers, and how they are shown: twelve significant digits, fixed
fcalc> ! notation from 1e-5 to 1e+11, scientific outside it.
fcalc> 42
42
fcalc> 1.5e-3
0.0015
fcalc> .5
0.5
fcalc> 5.
5
fcalc> 0.0001
0.0001
fcalc> 0.00001
0.00001
fcalc> 0.000001
1e-6
